  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Yedilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nKart\u0131n, herkese gere\u011Finden fazla g\xFCvendi\u011Fini
    anlat\u0131yor. K\u0131ymet biliyorlarsa baz\u0131lar\u0131na kar\u015F\u0131
    bu sorun olmam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. Fakat birileri taraf\u0131ndan iyi niyetinin
    suistimal edildi\u011Fi de a\xE7\u0131k. Ortaya koydu\u011Fun eforun, sevginin
    ya da eme\u011Fin kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 alamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    {{isim}}. Bunun olmas\u0131n\u0131 engelleyebilmek i\xE7in oyunlar kuruldu\u011Funu,
    birilerinin baz\u0131 dolaplar \xE7evirdi\u011Fini g\xF6r\xFCyorum. S\xFCtten
    a\u011Fz\u0131n fena yanm\u0131\u015F. Kimsenin alt metnini anlamadan, hi\xE7bir
    i\u015Fin ard\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeden hareket etmemeye nihayet karar
    vermi\u015Fsin. Duru\u015Funu sa\u011Flamla\u015Ft\u0131rm\u0131\u015F, sana
    davran\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 gibi davranmaya ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n;
    ne eksik, ne fazla..."
